sentences.text:
It is directed that the petitioner shall be released on bail, subject to the following conditions:-
(i) The petitioner shall execute a bond for a sum of Rs.50,000/- (Rupees fifty thousand only) with two solvent sureties each for the like sum to the satisfaction of Jaison Sebastian vs State Of Kerala on 16 November, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/187869494/
2 the Jurisdictional Court;
(ii) The petitioner shall report before the Investigating officer in Crime No.104 of 2023 of Vanitha Police Station, Idukki District, as and when summoned to do so;
(iii) The petitioner shall not attempt to influence or intimidate any witness in Crime No.104 of 2023 of Vanitha Police Station, Idukki District;
(iv) The petitioner shall not involve in any other crime while on bail.

